# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Dies Irae — Chapter Six: Teste David (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Dies Irae (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter Six (pp. 144–144)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Teste David, verbatim: the line editor’s farewell.
> Records: the chapter’s people and beings in `…-teste-david-*.actor`; its records in `…-teste-david-*.ttrpg`; sidebars in `…-teste-david-sidebars.ttrpg`; its places in `…-setting.setting`.

